usage: run_ackley_opt.py [-h] [--campaign-id CAMPAIGN_ID]
                         [--random-seed RANDOM_SEED]
                         [--initial-design-size INITIAL_DESIGN_SIZE]
                         [--batch-size BATCH_SIZE]
                         [--max-observations MAX_OBSERVATIONS]
                         [--backend {auto,botorch,baybe}]
                         [--acquisition-method ACQUISITION_METHOD]
                         [--artifact-dir ARTIFACT_DIR] [--poll-s POLL_S]
                         [--heartbeat-s HEARTBEAT_S] [--stop-file STOP_FILE]

Ackley 6D synthetic benchmark optimization via BO-MCP

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --campaign-id CAMPAIGN_ID
                        Resume existing campaign by ID (must contain ownership
                        marker) (default: None)
  --random-seed RANDOM_SEED
                        RNG seed for reproducible initialization (default: 42)
  --initial-design-size INITIAL_DESIGN_SIZE
                        Number of Sobol initial design points (default: 10)
  --batch-size BATCH_SIZE
                        Number of suggestions per generation call (default: 1)
  --max-observations MAX_OBSERVATIONS
                        Total evaluation budget (attempted evaluations)
                        (default: 60)
  --backend {auto,botorch,baybe}
                        BO backend to use (default: auto)
  --acquisition-method ACQUISITION_METHOD
                        Acquisition function (e.g., noisy_ei,
                        upper_confidence_bound, auto) (default: auto)
  --artifact-dir ARTIFACT_DIR
                        Directory for output artifacts (default: artifacts)
  --poll-s POLL_S       Poll interval in seconds (kept for compatibility)
                        (default: 180)
  --heartbeat-s HEARTBEAT_S
                        Heartbeat log interval in seconds (default: 1800)
  --stop-file STOP_FILE
                        Path to stop file; create to request graceful pause
                        (default: STOP)


